INSTRUCTIONS — google-services.json
=====================================
1. Go to: https://console.firebase.google.com
2. Select your Instantatoz project
3. Project Settings -> General -> Your apps
4. Add Android app with package name: com.instantatoz.app
5. Download google-services.json
6. Place it at: apps/mobile/google-services.json
7. NEVER commit this file to Git (already in .gitignore)
